flowchart LR
    View["EmployeeTaskManagerActivity (View)"]
    VM["TaskViewModel (StateFlow)"]
    Repo["TaskRepository"]
    API["REST API (GET /todos)"]

    View -->|User refresh / init| VM
    VM -->|Fetch tasks| Repo
    Repo -->|GET todos| API
    API -->|JSON TodoDto list| Repo
    Repo -->|"Mapped List<Task>"| VM
    VM -->|"TaskUiState StateFlow"| View

    API -.->|Internet / Server / Parsing Error| Repo
    Repo -.->|Refresh failure retains in-memory cache| VM
